  ],
  "description": "Engaged SD-1 audio path from the March 1981 factory notes. One-versus-two silicon diode feedback clipper. RC4558, 1N4148 and 2N3904 are proxies for µPC4558C, 1S2473 and 2SC732TM-GR. Drive uses 999 kΩ within stock 1 MΩ tolerance. Tone uses a linear taper proxy. D5 and D6 are represented by one two-junction equivalent with doubled ideality and series resistance. Electronic bypass and indicator are omitted.",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Drive",
      "Tone",
      "Level"
    ]
  },
  "name": "Boss SD-1 Super OverDrive",
  "outputNode": "out",
  "version": 3,
